{"src":"en","tgt":"bn","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"bn","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7709.374919000001,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":12836.340013,"text":"যদি আপনি ‘ন্যাশনাল ট্রেজার’ চলচ্চিত্রটি দেখে থাকেন, তাহলে আপনি হয়তো ভাববেন যে ‘ডিক্লারেশন অফ ইন্ডিপেন্ডেন্স’-এর পিছনে একটি ধনভাণ্ডারের মানচিত্র লেখা ছিল।"},{"kind":"audio","t":13050.087792999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13055.135343000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13060.291741000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13065.44862,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13070.879034000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13076.871109,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":13081.111172,"samples":26860,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"input","t":13873.346934000001,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":17181.397882,"text":"এই হট চকোলেটটি বেলজিয়ান মানদণ্ড অনুযায়ী। ফলের রসগুলো বেশ দামী, কিন্তু কিছুদিন পরেই আপনি এর মিষ্টতা অনুভব করতে পারবেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":17391.930253000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":17397.055892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17402.580754000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17408.064487,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":17413.813507000003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":17419.563496000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":17419.968709,"samples":1783,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":22206.753203,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":25157.089648,"text":"কিন্তু, এটা সত্য নয়। যদিও নথিটির পিছনে কিছু লেখা রয়েছে, তবে তা কোনো ধনভাণ্ডারের মানচিত্র নয়।"},{"kind":"audio","t":25295.508529000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25300.914463,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25306.345057000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":25311.678153,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25317.159706000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":25317.639309000002,"samples":6965,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":29976.254519000002,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":34704.663786,"text":"আপনি হয়তো নিজের দেশের বাইরের অন্যান্য সরকারগুলোর পরামর্শও নিতে চাইতে পারেন, কিন্তু তাদের পরামর্শগুলো তাদের নাগরিকদের জন্যই তৈরি করা হয়েছে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":34912.543699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34917.56474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34923.003064000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34928.210041,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34933.751924000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34939.135168,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":34939.557232,"samples":5962,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":41278.946913,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":45198.690358,"text":"হংকং দ্বীপই হংকং অঞ্চলকে এর নাম দিয়েছে, এবং এটি এমন একটি স্থান যা অনেক পর্যটক প্রধান আকর্ষণ হিসেবে বিবেচনা করেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":45350.240792000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45355.161234,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":45360.654917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45366.202849,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45371.624283,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":45377.333553000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":45377.759666,"samples":5962,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":49091.44627,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":52886.086023,"text":"যারা উচ্চ অক্ষাংশে বা পর্বতীয় অঞ্চলে গাড়ি চালাবেন, তাদের তুষার, বরফ বা পিচ্ছিল অবস্থার সম্ভাবনা বিবেচনা করা উচিত।"},{"kind":"audio","t":53040.124877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":53045.203397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":53050.457214,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":350,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":53055.845358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":53060.889319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":53066.604078000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":53068.179233,"samples":12092,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":58774.044813,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":61959.270583,"text":"বিচ্ছেদ ও পুনঃসংমিশ্রণ এই দুটি গোষ্ঠীর মধ্যে বৈচিত্র্যকে আগে-পিছে নড়াচড়া করায়।"},{"kind":"audio","t":62065.229788000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62070.643312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62075.752511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62081.195175,"samples":32377,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"input","t":62255.946382,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":63117.171523,"text":"প্রতিটি প্রজন্মের সাথে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":63159.10782,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":63159.547253000004,"samples":4848,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":66503.559942,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":69521.192932,"text":"কীটবিজ্ঞানীরা আনুষ্ঠানিক অর্থে এই ধরনের পোকামাকড়দের জন্য ‘বাগ’ শব্দটি ব্যবহার করেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":69624.071475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":69629.281943,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69635.064381,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69639.924995,"samples":30148,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":74703.344314,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":77971.965505,"text":"প্রথমত, বেশিরভাগ রাইডাররা হিলযুক্ত এবং মসৃণ, বেশ সংকীর্ণ সোলযুক্ত রাইডিং বুট পরেন।"},{"kind":"audio","t":78084.87244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78086.152089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":78087.598037,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":78089.557846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":78090.072197,"samples":14934,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":83900.882038,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":87691.15874,"text":"অক্টোবর মাসে শুরু হওয়া ব্যাপক সরকার-বিরোধী বিক্ষোভের জবাব হিসেবেই এই কমিশনটি গঠন করেছিলেন মার্টেল্লি।"},{"kind":"audio","t":87815.627132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87820.983987,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87826.392251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":87831.664368,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87835.579556,"samples":23851,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":700},{"kind":"input","t":91128.05172,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":93612.696259,"text":"রাত ১১:৩৫ নাগাদ অগ্নি নির্বাপক দলগুলো অবশেষে আগুন নিভিয়ে দেয়।"},{"kind":"audio","t":93710.754519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93716.175113,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93721.43672,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":93724.025309,"samples":19003,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":480},{"kind":"input","t":97366.939511,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":99993.038053,"text":"আটলান্টিক হ্যারিকেন মৌসুমের উত্তেজনাপূর্ণ ঝড়, সাবট্রপিক্যাল স্টর্ম জেরি।"},{"kind":"audio","t":100085.839806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100090.990764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100096.487137,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100098.498255,"samples":14823,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":100317.519832,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":101809.714395,"text":"আজ আটলান্টিক মহাসাগরে এটি গঠিত হয়েছে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":101874.52915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":190,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101879.673749,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101880.30944900001,"samples":7467,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":107228.623932,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":110060.009678,"text":"এর ফলেই আমাদের গাড়ি এবং অন্যান্য অনেক পরিবহন যন্ত্রপাতি প্রশিক্ষণ দিতে হয়েছে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":110161.264316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":240,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110166.677501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110172.118045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":110177.158945,"samples":30427,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":116604.16863100001,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":119780.209966,"text":"খ্রিস্টীয় ৪০০ সালের দিকে শুরু হয়ে দীর্ঘকাল ধরে চলা বিলাসিতার কেন্দ্র হিসেবে এটি বিখ্যাত।"},{"kind":"audio","t":119885.468332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119890.462343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":119895.67826,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119901.158644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":119901.456829,"samples":2396,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":120739.51893600001,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121888.527546,"text":"খ্রিস্টীয় ১১০০ সাল পর্যন্ত।"},{"kind":"audio","t":121944.703638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":210,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121949.01264,"samples":27418,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":127059.80886,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":128684.756544,"text":"চাঁদের পৃষ্ঠ শিলা ও ধূলিকণা দিয়ে গঠিত। চাঁদের বাইরের স্তরকে ক্রাস্ট বলা হয়।"},{"kind":"audio","t":128801.88061200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":128806.930852,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":128812.235568,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128817.745311,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128818.985711,"samples":9919,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":80},{"kind":"input","t":134203.711829,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":138489.606954,"text":"মার্কিন ইঞ্জিনিয়ার্স কর্পস অনুমান করেছে যে ছয় ইঞ্চি বৃষ্টিপাত পূর্বে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত অংশগুলোকে আরও ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করতে পারে।"},{"kind":"audio","t":138620.706411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138625.879239,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138631.392502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138636.852475,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138641.758638,"samples":29424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":141176.743881,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":145358.962495,"text":"বিশেষ করে, দাবি করা হয় যে মাইক্রো-অভিব্যক্তিগুলো সঠিকভাবে ব্যাখ্যা করে কোনো ব্যক্তি মিথ্যা বলছে কিনা তা শনাক্ত করা সম্ভব।"},{"kind":"audio","t":145510.294562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145515.533289,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145521.125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145526.410397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145531.767822,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145536.583496,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":145536.921651,"samples":111,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":147226.99587400001,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":149838.192852,"text":"কাঠামোতে গ্রাফিতি আঁকা বা খোঁচা দিয়ে এই স্থানটিকে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করবেন না।"},{"kind":"audio","t":149936.635325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":149941.767794,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":450,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149947.167989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149951.087577,"samples":24297,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":154863.341667,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":157967.930232,"text":"বাঘের গর্জন সিংহের জোরালো গর্জনের মতো নয়; বরং এটা ক্রুদ্ধ ও চিৎকারমূলক শব্দের মতো।"},{"kind":"audio","t":158049.144028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":270,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158054.266477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158055.3452,"samples":9696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"audio","t":158071.404326,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":158076.435026,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158077.918773,"samples":10811,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":161904.012818,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":165103.290596,"text":"২০শ শতাব্দীর গবেষণায় দেখা গেছে যে জেনেটিক ভিন্নতার দুটি ধরন রয়েছে—লুকানো ও প্রকাশিত।"},{"kind":"audio","t":165245.95773,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165250.818093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":165256.132699,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":200,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165261.349297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":165264.638145,"samples":20229,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"close","t":175303.980817,"code":1005}]}